space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Invisibility\"><img alt=\"Invisibility\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Invisible_Icon_ab037d.gif\" width=\"11\"/></span></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a></span></div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cursed\"><img alt=\"Cursed\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cursed_Icon_3dcdcb.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> makes you <a href=\"#/wiki/Cursed\">Cursed</a></span> (damage raises up to ?)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Bomb\">Poison Bomb</a> around itself</span></div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Summons\"><img alt=\"Summons\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Player_Summon_dc8280.gif\" width=\"11\"/></span></span></span> Summons</span> (1-2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Lancer%20Beetle\">Lancer Beetle</a>)</div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-creature-resistance-table\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Taken_From_Elements\">Damage Taken From Elements</span></h3>\n<div id=\"w-creature-resistance-d\">\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Physical\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Physical <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Bestiary Physical Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-el